# Copied in by `cargo xtask plugins` from examples/polyglot/generated/, which
# the emit command regenerates from the canonical Rust Order definition. Only the
# package clause is rewritten on the way in, because a c-shared plugin is
# package main.
/schema_gen.go

# Build output. `go build -buildmode=c-shared` writes the library and a C header
# named after it; the name follows DLL_PREFIX and DLL_SUFFIX so the host test
# suite can build the path the same way it builds the Rust fixture's.
/libsettle_go.so
/libsettle_go.dylib
/settle_go.dll
/libsettle_go.h
/settle_go.h
